{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2013-12", "window": 4, "start_date": 1387843200, "end_date": 1388534399, "month_true_total": 113, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:48:19 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "8465175", "author": {"steamid": "76561198063253689", "personaname": "little5rider", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/little5/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 9, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9, "last_played": 1388521369, "avatar": "85885ab678f9c5942b1e0672506d29850287db5e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing", "timestamp_created": 1388523022, "timestamp_updated": 1388523022, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8462652", "author": {"steamid": "76561198023788942", "personaname": "Low Cortisol LoL Enjoyer", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RCB20102023/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 138, "playtime_forever": 3629, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3607, "last_played": 1602773669, "avatar": "1df3535a6f4c9bcf76d310fff46700d18b98412c"}, "language": "english", "review": "The best representation of the 40k universe in a computer game so far.\n\nGreat Story.\n\nMultiplayer is simple and great.\n\nAbility to customize Space Marine suits/loadouts/accessories is a plus.", "timestamp_created": 1388515833, "timestamp_updated": 1388515833, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8455553", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039104456", "personaname": "Papa Franz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/FreshFriendz/", "num_games_owned": 1132, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 641, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 451, "last_played": 1744404486, "avatar": "904ec849a0b24005cbfb77840ba450cf9bf28dd7"}, "language": "english", "review": "You're killing crazy Orcs with your sawblade and rip them apart.\nWhat else do you need to know? :D\nGame falls little bit short ~6h and puts you into the Warhammer-universe.\nIf you don't like an \"dull\" hack&slash, don't buy this - otherwise, you'll love it! :)", "timestamp_created": 1388495269, "timestamp_updated": 1388495269, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8453583", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992991423", "personaname": "Mofobian", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Mofobian/", "num_games_owned": 282, "num_reviews": 107, "playtime_forever": 5353, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5035, "last_played": 1725548695, "avatar": "7c8b5a668d81e4ce2881e4bc354efb11d5e6962a"}, "language": "english", "review": "I absolutely loved playing through this game and mindlessly grinding away my days in Exterminatus. It's worth the investment, quite brutal.", "timestamp_created": 1388488250, "timestamp_updated": 1388488250, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "8446342", "author": {"steamid": "76561198014699215", "personaname": "Thunderkat274", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198014699215/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 300, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 97, "last_played": 1480979111, "avatar": "902885a22681dcdae102163cbc852e7c42f4c93d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Brutal simply put brutality at its finest. The Warhammer world is already filled with great story lines and the Space Marines are no exception. In this game you follow Captain Titus and his team and carve your way through thousands upon thousands of Orks in this master piece of a third person shooter/brawling title. The game features a variety of weapons all are very gratifing to use from the starting gun, the bolt pistol, to some of the more classifed weapons such as the vengence launcher. Each weapon has its own kick and sounds like your firing a truly elite weapon each and every single round. The game's melee combat is just as exception as its ranged combat I dare say its even better. From a dagger to a chain saw sword, and a massive hammer the game also features a varity of melee weapons that suit many different play styles all feel great to use and the melee movement and fluidty are astounding. For War hammer fans this game is a must. If your just a fan of smashing little green monsters with giant weapons and guns this game is for you.", "timestamp_created": 1388459741, "timestamp_updated": 1388459741, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}